==Battleground==
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Zroco]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Madam Peng]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Rain D.]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*2 [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*20 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Zigge]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Rain D.]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The 2 Zir Zeals can be quite a hassle to deal with, as they can easily burrow right in front of your base. For this reason, it is best to fight from afar; bring strong attackers such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] to take them out as fast as possible. They can also greatly assist in taking down the Madam Pengs, although your [[Fedora Cat (Special Cat)|Blue Nyanko Rangers]] and [[Scarf Cat (Special Cat)|Red Nyanko Rangers]] shouldn't struggle with that much either. As for Rain D., he stands no chance against an army of [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]].

